{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A daughter of a humble baker by day and a magical girl by destiny, Kaho\u2019s bread-fueled justice comes to life with a freshly-baked moveset that\u2019s as charming as it is chaotic. Whether flinging baguette blasts or unleashing croissant combos, she\u2019s ready to roll\u2026 and rise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852960/extras/911212e8adf56a4647212ced695dec89.avif?t=1755484087\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set against the vibrant backdrop of Los Angeles, California the downloadable content package includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One new playable character Kaho Shibuya, a magical girl with the powers of cuteness and bread, available to use on Co-Op- and Battlegrounds Mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four new enemy mob characters to battle through on the new stage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand-new stage set in a fictional \u201cLA,\u201d dressed up for Anime Expo season available on Co-Op Mode.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852960?t=1755484087","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852960?t=1755484087","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852960/98580be69404f8c8d5249ca1276d251c2c3652b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755484087","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852960/98580be69404f8c8d5249ca1276d251c2c3652b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755484087","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online C